      "content": "i know you're trying to help but it doesn't feel like that. it feels more like there's just no space for me here. like the world is full and i'm just this extra thing that doesn't fit. sometimes i think i'm just wasting time and energy trying to exist when it would be so much simpler if i just wasn't.",
